{"914740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Hate Robots", "steam_appid": 914740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I Hate Robots</strong> – a dark sci-fi action shooter.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hate robots, and your only goal is to destroy every metal creature in your path. You must journey through dangerous portals to find the machine lair and wipe them off the face of the earth!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse levels with unique objectives: survive enemy onslaughts, explore gloomy locations, and hunt for scientific artifacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arsenal of 7 weapon types to eliminate your foes, each effective against specific enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multitude of robots and their modifications—from small scout drones to powerful turrets and kamikaze spiders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, atmospheric levels with a sci-fi aesthetic, filled with tension and the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging gameplay—limited resources, constant threats, and the need to stay alert at all times.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A</strong>re you ready to step into the unknown?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step could be your last. Can you find and destroy all the robots and safely escape their planet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I Hate Robots</strong> – a dark sci-fi action shooter.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hate robots, and your only goal is to destroy every metal creature in your path. You must journey through dangerous portals to find the machine lair and wipe them off the face of the earth!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse levels with unique objec